    <string name="settings_changelog_v143_title">Version 1.4.3 (Latest)</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v143_item1">• SD Card &amp; External Storage Support: Full MicroSD card compatibility with MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permission.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v143_item2">• Scoped Storage Bypass: Completely resolved 0 audio tracks detected issue when importing from SD Card.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v143_item3">• Native C++ Audio on SD Card: Bit-perfect USB DAC Exclusive and Oboe playback enabled directly on SD Card audio files.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v143_item4">• Smart Dual-Mode Fallback: Robust folder scanner seamlessly switching between POSIX File and DocumentFile.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v142_title">Version 1.4.2</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v142_item1">• USB DAC Exclusive Stability: Completely resolved CPU lockup, ANR, and app freezing during track switching or playlist navigation.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v142_item2">• UAC2 Microframe Clock Sync: Real-time 48kHz integer microframe ratio (6 frames/packet) eliminating fractional timing drift on High-Speed USB DACs.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v142_item3">• Zero-Crossing Distortion Fix: Symmetrical rounding and anti-deadband clamping preserving soft whisper ASMR audio clarity.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v142_item4">• Playlist Repeat All Fix: Resolved issue where Repeat All looped only the current track; now seamlessly cycles through the entire playlist.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v141_title">Version 1.4.1</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v141_item1">• Custom Audio Folder Import: Seamlessly import external audio folders from Internal Storage and SD Card.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v141_item2">• Zero-Storage Multi-Track Albums: Play multi-file ASMR folders as unified virtual albums without duplicating or merging files.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v141_item3">• Non-RJ Local Audio Support: Import arbitrary audio collections with automatic ID3 tag extraction and persistent synthetic IDs.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v141_item4">• DLsite Metadata Linking: Link non-RJ or local works directly to official DLsite works with HD covers and official metadata.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v141_item5">• Smart Import Preview Dialog: Instant pre-import scan showing singles, multi-track albums, and file integrity verification.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v140_title">Version 1.4.0</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v140_item1">• In-App Auto-Updater: Direct version updates via GitHub Releases with Smart Dual-Channel Matching (debug vs release).</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v140_item2">• HiBy-Style UI Redesign: Dedicated Playlist Collection screen directly shown on launch.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v140_item3">• Multi-Field Sorting Bar: Sort by Custom, Date, Title, Duration, and RJ Code with tap-to-toggle Ascending / Descending.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v140_item4">• Ultra-Smooth Drag Reordering: Physics-based collision detection with animateItem() spring transitions and haptic feedback.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v140_item5">• Bit-Perfect USB DAC Buffer Expansion: 128ms kernel URB depth &amp; 131k-frame SPSC ring buffer eliminating audio crackle during scrolling.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v140_item6">• 0ms Instant Cold-Launch Startup: Synchronous playlist cache loading with zero loading delay on frame 1.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v140_item7">• Player Ergonomics Polish: Playback transport controls elevated by 44dp for thumb reach; resolved duplicate RJ badge.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v132_title">Version 1.3.2</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v132_item1">• Native C++ Audio Engine: Google Oboe Exclusive MMAP &amp; miniaudio bit-perfect DAC streaming.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v132_item2">• True Bit-Perfect USB Mode: Direct hardware bypass for external DACs without OS mixer resampling.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v132_item3">• Zero-Jank UI &amp; ANR Prevention: Fully asynchronous background USB device discovery and non-blocking state cache.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v132_item4">• Hot-Unplug Protection: Auto-pause playback safely when USB DAC or headphones are disconnected.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v132_item5">• No Double Attenuation: Hardware volume control directly drives DAC amplifier with full-scale PCM output.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v131_title">Version 1.3.1</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v131_item1">• Full UI Localization: Complete support for English, Indonesian, Japanese (日本語), and Simplified Chinese (简体中文).</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v131_item2">• Automatic System Language Detection: App automatically matches your device\'s default locale.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v131_item3">• In-App Language Selector: Switch language anytime in Settings without changing phone system language.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v131_item4">• Android 13+ Per-App Language Support: Integrated with native Android per-app language preferences.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v130_title">Version 1.3.0</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v130_item1">• Smart DLsite ASMR Translator: Bilingual title and chapter translation with custom DLsite vocabulary dictionary.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v130_item2">• Fuseji Mask Unmasking &amp; Normalization: Restores masked characters (○, ●, ×) for clean and natural translations.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v130_item3">• Smart Fast Remux Engine: Instant audio merging (&lt; 1s) without transcoding, maintaining 100% loss-free quality.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v130_item4">• 4-Tier Hybrid Chapter Engine &amp; CUE Sheet: High-precision chapter markers, auto .cue export, and interactive chapter sheet.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v130_item5">• Ultra-Smooth 120 FPS Scrolling: Optimized playlist drawer and download history rendering with zero frame drops.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v130_item6">• Universal Link &amp; Multi-Site Resolver: Supports asmr.one, japaneseasmr.com, DLsite links, and RJ auto-prefix.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v130_item7">• Enhanced Metadata Enrichment: Syncs CV, Circle, Genre, and HD Cover from DLsite &amp; asmr.one.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v121_title">Version 1.2.1</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v121_item1">• Instant Storage Auto-Sync (120 FPS): Lag-free background scanning.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v121_item2">• Recursive Subfolder Scanning: Automatic detection of storage subdirectories.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v121_item3">• Collection Subfolder Categories: Automatic folder filters and create folder action.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v121_item4">• Move to Folder Feature: Transfer audio between subfolders instantly.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v120_title">Version 1.2.0</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v120_item1">• Smart Sleep Timer: Countdown auto-pauses when playback is paused.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v120_item2">• Interactive Floating Mini Player across Queue, Library, and Settings tabs.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v120_item3">• New Default Playback Speed Dialog with smooth slider &amp; 2x3 presets.</string>
    <string name="settings_changelog_v120_item4">• Floating Hardware Volume HUD: Ultra-slim and solid.</string>

